<title>ESTONIA: KALEV TO DISCUSS PROFIT DISTRIBUTION.</title>
<headline>KALEV TO DISCUSS PROFIT DISTRIBUTION.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Estonian confectioner Kalev is set to discuss the 1996 profit distribution and bonus share issue to be proposed at a later shareholder meeting, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The council will discuss the proposal on Thursday morning,&quot; a representative of Kalev told Reuters.</p>
<p>The shareholder meeting is on June 27.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6 209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
